WI-razol made taint propagation HONOUR ambiguous_names; this is about the LIST.
Seven catalogued python primitives had short names that also name a builtin or a
dict/list/set/str method and were not suppressed, so a bare unresolved call to
them was falsely matched: all, copy, count, filter, remove, update, values.

DERIVED, NOT HAND-PICKED, BECAUSE HAND-PICKING IS WHAT LEFT THE GAP. The item
was filed for `copy` alone; the campaign plan then generalised to "all seven
shutil peers", which is wrong in BOTH directions -- copytree / rmtree /
make_archive collide with nothing and must stay matchable, while five Django ORM
names that DO collide were missed entirely. The guard test asserts the RULE
(every catalogued primitive whose short name is a builtin/container method must
be suppressed) rather than seven literals, so a colliding primitive added later
fails CI the day it lands. A second test asserts the converse -- distinctive
names must NOT be suppressed -- because over-suppression costs recall silently.

THE FILED REPRO IS CLOSED AND RE-RUN. python:external:0-0:copy:external_symbol
no longer matches shutil.copy under call_construct in {None, function, method},
and a module-qualified python:shutil:0-0:copy STILL matches -- suppression must
not trade a false positive for a false negative. This settles the question the
item's own June discussion left open: io-boundary:F3 DID close the method-form
case; the function-form and meta-absent forms were the residue.

MEASURED, AND IT MOVES NOTHING ON THE COHORT. 1509 python unresolved taint call
edges carry one of the seven names, so the shape is abundant -- but 1505 of 1509
are METHOD-form, already suppressed by F3's kind-aware gate, and the remaining 4
carry disambiguating module hints. Prevention, not a measured improvement.
Reported as such rather than as a win.

VERIFICATION LIMIT, DISCLOSED. The only source change is a YAML data file, which
is invisible to smart-test's import-graph slicer (L43), so the committed
manifest selects ONE test file and the per-PR gate will exercise that alone. The
regression evidence is a local full run of the hypergumbo-core package (10,929
passed, 2 skipped, 12 xfailed) plus the twice-daily full-suite -- not the per-PR
gate. Do not read this PR's green as a regression signal.

